80	945,478,1178,790	Fig. 80.	A short piece of Flax-stem, magnified and cut across at the top, showing the bark outside, a ring of wood, and the pith in the centre.
81	1242,486,1630,793	81. Exogenous Stems.	A year-old Maple shoot cut crosswise and lengthwise: the rounded cross-section at the top shows wood in rays around the pith, and the split face shows bark, wood and pith.
